---
title: "initialize (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate caller is Legion operator
    q_validate --> q_check_key: validate ECIES publicKey point on curve
    q_check_key --> q_check_timing: validate startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_check_tokens: validate bidToken != address(0) AND askToken != address(0)
    q_check_tokens --> q_check_admin: validate projectAdmin != address(0)
    q_check_admin --> q_set_key: publicKey = eciesPublicKey
    q_set_key --> q_set_timing: startTime = _startTime, endTime = _endTime, refundEndTime = _refundEndTime
    q_set_timing --> q_set_tokens: bidToken = _bidToken, askToken = _askToken
    q_set_tokens --> q_set_min: minimumInvestAmount = _minimumInvestAmount
    q_set_min --> q_set_admin: projectAdmin = _projectAdmin
    q_set_admin --> q_set_registry: addressRegistry = _addressRegistry
    q_set_registry --> q_set_fees: set fee structures (legion, referrer)
    q_set_fees --> [*]: emit Initialized event

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: only Legion operators can initialize
        INV-002: publicKey must be valid EC point
        INV-003: startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
        INV-004: bidToken and askToken are non-zero addresses
    end note
